      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The alkali metal-templated addition of aryloxides across the double bond of non-conjugated cyclopropenes is described. High cis-selectivity is achieved through a directing effect of a strategically positioned carboxamide functionality."},
